<title>JAPAN: BOJ's Matsushita to visit Switzerland Jan 11-15.</title>
<headline>BOJ's Matsushita to visit Switzerland Jan 11-15.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will visit Switzerland from January 11 to 15, the BOJ said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>He will be attending the monthly meeting of 10 central bank governors at the Bank of International Settlements in Basle.</p>
</text>
